#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD2010 expect=noViolation domain=CE
#note "CE is in the rule's Domains scope and --HLT resolves to CEHLT (Events-class model Variable Qualifier). Every populated CEHLT is a High Level Term of the (dummy) MedDRA dictionary; the sheet says Case-insensitive, so the lower-case variant passes too; the empty CEHLT on row 3 does not fire."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#dictionaries dummy
dataset CE
col USUBJID type=Char
col CEHLT   type=Char
---
001 | Headaches NEC
001 | nausea and vomiting symptoms
002 |
